    cml:operator "Implication" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Establishes an implication between conduct and ceasing citizenship." ;
    cml:premiseText "(a) the person: (i) engaged in conduct specified in subsection (5) while outside Australia; or (ii) engaged in conduct specified in any of paragraphs (5)(a) to (h) while in Australia, has since left Australia and has not been tried for an offence in relation to the conduct;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "...and it would be contrary to the public interest for the person to remain an Australian citizen." ;
